            </connector>
            <label>If Not Existing</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>V2 - Case creation has been removed from this flow; it will now be handled within the Bot Create Case flow. - #33714
This flow is used for routing messaging sessions created from ANZ Chats to &apos;ANZ RQW queue&apos;. If no agents are present, then it will display &quot;No agents are available&quot; and route to a &apos;No Agents&apos; Bot. cloned version</description>
